                       PDFIUM BUNDLE — LICENCE AND NOTICES

This repository builds and packages PDFium. It does not author it.

PDFium is the PDF rendering library developed by Google and the Chromium
project, and it is the work of those authors. Everything this repository
distributes in dist/ — the static library and its headers — is compiled from
their source, unmodified. Credit for the library belongs to them; please direct
bug reports about PDF rendering upstream, at https://pdfium.googlesource.com/.

The build scripts (build.sh, build.ps1) are the original work of this
repository's author and are offered under the same BSD 3-Clause terms below, so
that the whole is distributable as one unit.

